The project utilizes the *PERN stack*, a popular choice for modern web development, aimed at consistency (JavaScript/TypeScript everywhere) and performance.

*Frontend:*
- *React*: For building the component-based user interface.
- *Redux*: For global state management (user session, cart).
- *Vanilla CSS*: For styling the application.

*Backend:*
- *Node.js & Express*: For the server-side runtime and RESTful API framework.
- *TypeScript*: To add static typing to JavaScript, reducing runtime errors.
- *Prisma*: As an Object-Relational Mapper (ORM) to simplify database interactions.
- *JWT (JSON Web Tokens)*: For secure, stateless authentication.

*Database & Infrastructure:*
- *PostgreSQL*: A powerful, open-source relational database.
- *Docker*: To containerize the backend, frontend, and database, ensuring the application runs consistently across different development machines.
